      "meaning": "Sorcery is the practice of magic, like using spells or trying to tell the future, sometimes with the supposed help of evil spirits. Sorcerers pretended they could predict events, heal sickness, or do miracles. The Bible warns that God judges people who practice it or trust in it.",
